# Deploy frontend to webserver

When you change any front-end code (Vue, assets, public files), **always** make the changes visible on the live site by:

1. **Building** the frontend: `cd front-end && npm run build`
2. **Reloading nginx** (optional but recommended): `sudo nginx -t && sudo systemctl reload nginx`

Or run the project script once: `./deploy-frontend.sh`

Nginx serves from `front-end/dist`, so building updates the live site at smbistro.duckdns.org.
